## Auth Architecture

Auth state lives in `client/contexts/AuthContext.tsx` (separate from CalendarContext). It wraps the entire app via `<AuthProvider>` in `client/App.tsx`.

### Account type (`client/types/auth.ts`)

interface Account { id, name, email, initials, color }
```

